{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a4e58a243ac4c84fb59727008682f423a71b14965d920ef9daa9c9da2279255",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c82fd3bcc6efa46fed31eb0c616c57a231acf0bb96e1805fb87b3fc51a491db5",
      "text": "合缘奇缘",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5626db13c9ae9a853d467fec681edcc8be3f68e6b7b0de31c419884f0f6dc5e4",
      "text": "参加了多次试镜，\n却接连惨败的三人组。\n面对感到焦躁与内疚的硲，\n山下和舞田如往常一样安慰着他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c82fd3bcc6efa46fed31eb0c616c57a231acf0bb96e1805fb87b3fc51a491db5",
      "text": "合缘奇缘",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af12e94767a8496559298c5d7db460fefa6ff20d396acce27727125674d32737",
      "text": "……今天的试镜也是\n不合格吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:994cbea0fc50416ec4b82e7c9e769baaa1790cf72e36302b66f3ada57e83e7a8",
      "text": "是呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55d041be93d5c0c4a2a75c3254615b7918611fcfbdd89508968b1a74fb7792ec",
      "text": "No problem啦！Mr. 硲的\npassion已经传达给大家了哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7718f2f34a296b666ee44741ae97124533976ca34ffa89180ad03a715ee9ffe",
      "text": "……嘛，确实。硲先生一旦滔滔不绝讲起热情来，\n哪里的评委都听得出神呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a59e6e04f07fff0efac2d5d5125469a0e61f30ef6a1150b0d90483e7987029f",
      "text": "只是，这种事情可能还讲究运气啊机缘啊，\n诸如此类人力无可奈何的因素吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:756f6e36206a9c4a194afc0e174907f97dfd3618bda54bc8bbd0c4d814d90868",
      "text": "……之前寄出的\n资料审核结果怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4e45f7e8e3ab2326b1ed1625504aa97c3ade957356346dda7a56a2fa9e1038a",
      "text": "没戏呢！这样就10连败了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac4686ad33663a502e05f1fb135d1934b87cd4b4334a6322a5cfb9f5423f9af",
      "text": "那不就是说，全灭了嘛……\n类在这种时候还真是有精神呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80c9af5bbd5f450aa42bedd28276facb29b330b5b50348763189d23d9515f6cf",
      "text": "会吗？我觉得和平时一样就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffdf7e4ed1311e3be49b9991ba24370294ee68899277ef0b1a81d93832bb1f0e",
      "text": "这就是年轻的差距吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f840881e16f62d2cd568a7ae6d8fcec398e2418d02695c54303e5bc397c18472",
      "text": "……你们两个，我们来商量一下\n下一次试镜的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7488dc2728787fb3ec5128174300d969e5218124ebf5f31eaad4878917c2966c",
      "text": "不能再落选下去了。\n应该重新制定对策。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e8674b915da082bafd3760997b37eeb75c993f8e6e1bde2bc7286310b29980",
      "text": "在Next challenge之前呢，\n肚子也饿了，要不要休息一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f48e24003ef06036728b7df5b0e3b85e6ee2ebdae385b343120ec0670b5b199",
      "text": "我去便利店买晚饭回来哦。\n大家就顺便来一场野外dinner吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d8852c2799148c4079663a1524080010bbbc40dc6c5722b828ee0e0ddf05e22",
      "text": "嘛，偶尔这样也不错呢。\n能拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134508e33080cac9ee425937903af577ec799b0ad5d098bfd68000517c7b7a20",
      "text": "All right！Mr. 硲的那份我也会\n买回来的。稍微等我一下哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a11992bb9421017cef2c7d55482ff82e34c6816de749dc4fbfe90416f04b7a44",
      "text": "……舞田君积极的态度，\n总是能帮到我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7b31a5d120def4a7a6e315e05e6de9caa3d5518046ac66c7fd5bdae5f0820b9",
      "text": "哈哈，确实。从这一点来说，\n那家伙搞不好最适合当偶像呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a03a62e0dd14f58570d8ebb8140b92f6ef492eb6c252bb9bd77ccc92952c87cb",
      "text": "是啊……不，\n我们身上应该也有同样的特质。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0e3ae5fbc2797b0a52937a63abe2ceb1fd2b3a81bfa9d9bc207a5bdce0f87d",
      "text": "这胸中燃烧的热情，绝没有任何差错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:418b8b9398ac624f57e774df8ddf3321cc1e7667373177b18d681d4cc605e04c",
      "text": "只是……或许应该考虑一下\n能让人印象更深刻的自我展示方法了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3abe95497ff4cbaa84055affdb9f7f1d61901539a4d646b04864504c70901c68",
      "text": "嗯——……我觉得其实已经相当\n让人印象深刻了就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d480a986d9db7a3a1b7725406826556f9541acf3d993b5785ac4facc83f0dd9c",
      "text": "要不拿出教师的派头，把今天试镜的内容\n拿出来复习一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "数小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e6fd077fba856da0156168861de57a20fdb631b8a84d0dcd98b835e07c347e",
      "text": "硲先生、舞田先生、山下先生。我认为三位\n都是极具魅力的人选。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00ee56857963131e20450e65c476370513c2a8ce1c39e09eba4fbdb9c0afc24d",
      "text": "现在进入偶像业界的话，\n不得不面对与年轻对手们的竞争。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a90f673c547d09c1743ba41595813d51da1992529536dbf418e0b4c5d95e656",
      "text": "从年龄上来看是否有些严峻呢……\n虽然我们有这样的顾虑，不知三位怎么看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:574bc5d25e5bb6c36c5c8b99b67ec81f1f4879920ad442da8f8e29aa610e807c",
      "text": "年龄无关紧要。\n重要的是热情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08dd117ba0264e17b08fbada6ed841a12dc46dcdd7d8ee356708d1969362029a",
      "text": "热情能跨越一切隔阂，\n必定能传达给对方！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ec2d979f224b7d81e7737437b7b650eefabe69b65b7ff722de08846a541652",
      "text": "正如您所言，在这个年纪以偶像为目标的人\n或许确实鲜有先例。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1388442179a146c94adc111d2a0d9fcdd67a278a17aafcc1f96775f3888efc2",
      "text": "但是，正因如此，我相信\n有些事情是只有我们能传达给年轻人的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0eb53f16e955ec11757a1986f5dc0171dbf6e3efd2d17baf2db86a7a51ab929",
      "text": "唔……舞田先生、山下先生。\n二位也是同样的心情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b197c1fbcb5eebd14287434f2d07e11d891386e18b98d0ec8e1e05f6bf6ee5e",
      "text": "Of course！那当然了☆\nMr. 山下也是这样对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e3262e585f9ea0e46e804018049b58fa61a371f9946af8875ba1ef6ee03d4c5",
      "text": "这个嘛……我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ffa93dd4a35a524d71f86de30f4008515aecac0735fde6dd16709f8f546bb49",
      "text": "嘛，说实话，我没什么自信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59b4629220f33a4e5893c373cb165015a58dc2608e141ce3fac424135e6be6e8",
      "text": "连我自己都觉得，目前在做的事\n相当乱来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a06e9a0ff2236f7a4382f4dc6000ca11c7b0e89f6d9e871ac44d230f86e30b40",
      "text": "像这样每天跑试镜，\n就已经累得精疲力尽了。哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5574c0ea1c9fa75ab1015355bd4558949892a673eb2218bb66cefd990676c23",
      "text": "山下君……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9a00c3c71953452310f2356af3d041b53e97d0038962e80f5d16c677c59f200",
      "text": "只是……那个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ce7108742c622753df4c2abccf71df92c4ac2fb53b2566a10d84f2fac3802f9",
      "text": "我们是打算认认真真去做的。\n我、类，当然还有硲先生都是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eda7effe5c660a85bb587a449422a36ae7cc767152bf35f5e98dc84177acec74",
      "text": "特别是硲先生说的那份热情，\n给浑浑噩噩过日子的我也树立了目标。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44bf3e08555810f1130e2465f5f7ec7600f66795cee3838ae849173c6a372a26",
      "text": "这个人的话，绝不仅仅是浮于表面。\n我认为是蕴含着改变某种事物的力量的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d52141166f90a537fdfad2b3feeb1347249d9d40e32d1c9493fe2637c845a26",
      "text": "单论心情的话，我们可不会输给年轻人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:916f5bd6766c63c35f4d457a60ff77c9c525a4927e38eb966dca425877f3a442",
      "text": "Mr. 山下……very cool！\n就是说啊！我们可不会输给任何人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ee29e53541fc5b68ef3d10776fa9de19958dd1e7dd83cefb4a28cdbae7128e",
      "text": "嘛，太大的话我也说不出口就是了。\n大致就是这样，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8efe76df738efc386ac661e9b214e0ef32baade029f59230235f936920951d2",
      "text": "原来如此……非常感谢。\n结果我们稍后会再行联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b63a401bc7b21c3b5b6715bff7432a4fb9c44e2260f6d0e51e162a372c0004",
      "text": "……山下君帮我打圆场的\n那个时候，我真的很吃惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74aec4a1b40576dc8684e67f4f01fa0d1fc1a7222a9c666280aedea385cabcb1",
      "text": "没想到你能为我说到那个地步。……谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7c1f3d27a0c999980a5b31c784b86396aa13a61a95ead4128a41ff413b55f9",
      "text": "哪里哪里，我也没说什么了不起的话。\n只是把想到的说出口了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcae9aa1c57137bfe722ff2084dabf4e5fa8504dfbe31212ef15994c9a55486e",
      "text": "而且，结果试镜\n还是没通过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dc927f2a16480c192684481fa9ffe0764760252af8888759cbd1b80ac470d51",
      "text": "嘿嘿，果然事情不会那么顺利呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a4ca5db89bd2271394a7ee3cf891cad955f360a1932ae29af572de6603e3165",
      "text": "……对不起。\n是我任性的梦想，把你们给卷进来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1490f7457f4222e72e680632f62b5598e6d33a1e5886e5b6c1ee7b3da5dc3b",
      "text": "简直就像是我让你们放弃了\n作为教师的光明人生一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6699b8c09b5e3a76c3e4896e7de3d230ffefda0c8f2489194d28206ed653bb7",
      "text": "太夸张了啦。用不着为我的人生操心啦。\n类看起来也很开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28ef826f8dbd5a1c3690c4deee1a0d65f9f5f2e19724de2bfa3962f3e71777df",
      "text": "可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:946d2669c8e9ddf1d75c0972795946fec0f8ca52698a4cc9ef2880a6538f99a5",
      "text": "总觉得今天的硲先生，\n难得这么消沉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ec2b18a494698cb5dc4a1d8c703f5e904c70dab6695dce03ce8b71f76f0e73",
      "text": "因为听到了你的真心话。\n正因如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949bbc8317cdb68f060890294a8532295ff5aea3ff0b737abdcbbdb4c4b352f2",
      "text": "……我才觉得自己很不中用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aededde11cc23afcca2a75a9395f069b353e56ccfc0d8ecab7cf5fb1ce4dfff0",
      "text": "……硲先生。\n我只是擅自跟着你过来而已哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f38d7cc74fbb222f881b931f4697346bbd33d3d0ce0efe8b67234fd4ad2c717e",
      "text": "我打小就是随随便便过日子的。\n这次的事也是一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3473258498950526c941fc2c4732174dcc8c222b7db68e31e065c5ea38943edf",
      "text": "（父母双亡，跟亲戚也没什么走动。\n我不管做什么，都不会给任何人添麻烦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56c338bdda0f0dbbc055daab7873d7a56300d735cf9eb482154ad8e1d1853c03",
      "text": "所以，硲先生完全没有必要\n感到有一丁点儿的责任。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5574c0ea1c9fa75ab1015355bd4558949892a673eb2218bb66cefd990676c23",
      "text": "山下君……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35bea8d7868259792d9170faf572684b8a04d285ec54f106b0c98403804f3e53",
      "text": "更重要的是……现在，其实挺开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8a7726b4500ccd51893ed557baeb252f9374d30ad25c320dd3374dfab2643a6",
      "text": "比起继续当教师，\n总觉得现在的人生更璀璨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2db6db5c83d8e64f25ca3c132ea47086374e55b704ed50c73ce9855c74c1b89",
      "text": "这一切全都多亏了硲先生。\n所以……非常感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1df9b934b1af46b38cf33860384e410f78ef1e6b1e01ad339112efffb6bb0eb",
      "text": "……我才要谢谢你。山下君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6850b950fa1a47d0ef642c58e799b287da359d3426d7a826ceff7621281344b",
      "text": "嘿嘿。下次再加油吧。\n肯定能找到合适的事务所的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dbf444eed0c296532d0302e77f9808714877e932097eacb650abefa87c15a61",
      "text": "喂——今天的dinner！\n买回来啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78ef3ef38142a68a3b368231c1f93278daa3f3e73bc6e55ef7ef7ab7fc410677",
      "text": "辛苦啦。\n买了些什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b60361cdbc77aa9478c927405f1d1a226a0e59b1cd5b8fc62620744ea8b6734",
      "text": "要说野外dinner的话，\n果然还是得barbecue吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cb9927b3226daf9fa8c648ab5edf20cbcb8d2d0a2a6ec851b04c516b82d9610",
      "text": "但是没有铁板，所以就买了烤串和beer\n回来啦☆ 用这个来干杯吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d231fc90f6c033236b501e0c817d42be002bda1f5d83fab8d6e7ae2a8e14a9",
      "text": "哦，不错嘛！\n借此提提神喝一杯吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d77b2f6060a7f8ee296c7b807bf82fadc0a0290d3be17b7722d670ef9a2ddc0",
      "text": "大叔要转换心情的话，\n来一杯啤酒是最管用的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6e42fc7e5093779b675f1c7d34a6e17fe9861096be48ae1f0ebc3176ebf70d7",
      "text": "对吧？硲先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4a48ad4d8dec9bbcc763f317f3430f2bf3fa883fa2d64b185ad1ffa8d0da27",
      "text": "……也是呢。\n先转换一下心情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012e7e6d1362f84218a98910f6d79306db68b4bc8c2b2a37611d7a8764ac07f6",
      "text": "来来，二位！\nGlass准备OK了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab8bc189a87eafd9f4224a4ba6e8fed18800e3cd008cc1e70f660fba8caa0a8",
      "text": "虽说只是罐装啤酒就是了。\n硲先生也请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de18ef7229d6de64fd312c1b5aad4ffeec24486d9d27e3430ee0f0c0828d93c",
      "text": "……呵。只要和你们在一起，\n烦恼好像就烟消云散了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_g:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02aaa528747229112ccb69636b89307457e69b635ff35f1ad0527216d26126a0",
      "text": "谢谢你们，山下君、舞田君。\n今后也要……绝不放弃继续前进！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128ba3253b56eedfd92fd27247193a4a53de3e5a1bbed1709539db08438162b1",
      "text": "次郎的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a645a3ee8ce5699a67cee110dc84d87d47a68ccfa7f303f4d36397493901eeea",
      "text": "那么，接下来该怎么办呢。\n重整旗鼓寻找下家固然是好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90fd721eb3a1a6c048797b178dbd78ed77456cc17f3b278c79319248166286f0",
      "text": "类，有下次试镜的头绪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a75ecd92e8204afad32b03f220f39e1e1d6feaeab466ac53c73e8ae7c72a45",
      "text": "唔～……酒已经\nno more please了啦～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4801e438a09f239a612ec1489ff6f25a75cb3c7beda7ca5f6bda51a1b0d4cf4e",
      "text": "居然在别人家里睡得这么香，\n真是的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:480bb414c4cfe069cf64937ef6ad01d29edef23959809c45e5a6fc0c8875c6b2",
      "text": "……来看看类买回来的\n偶像情报杂志吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aefee7b5cdb8a1ce548297cd118ca9c7cf9d5ef3ad9b673dfe7c8ac714cf6193",
      "text": "话虽如此，到处都去试过了呢。\n差不多该走投无路了，吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8de995297e319de850998729e50895eead9733288fad52bc20ab57ac8db0dca",
      "text": "就不能像这样，有大好的机会\n自己送上门来吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ea47c5d02aa14e287a5a4b27cd39d11dfb1b65777633c1eede8ccd7547518a",
      "text": "（……说到机会。之前帮我猜中赛马的\n那个人，遇到这种时候会怎么做呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d7281dbb793184b8189d6762aa64ac5e86503dcbe252c755c7ec6c7f500e9b",
      "text": "（果然还是能一把抓中命中注定的事务所吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5b7249b19a5735123bcb1598b6272e4a28e0a9ea8ffde2196a63374f24827d5",
      "text": "……哦，发现了一家在办试镜的事务所！\n这么小的报导亏我能找得出来啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c7a96693ca7b16c64674c86576251fde9d8f413de27763556a07c5d9bb0452",
      "text": "我看看……315？\n不对……315 Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bc348441d462d48e0734b1e3553bf5bab0502d1a38196c582829556b028749c",
      "text": "315 Production……没听说过呢。\n是刚刚成立的地方吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d8e2ab581cb0c9fb67f1918ff5103410e98010b6605e5e6b26bcd226a196d4b",
      "text": "等等？搞不好这种地方反而\n比大公司更容易合格呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f62451a6f1bd6984b65874c1cddfd58cfe0e2892fcb7c419d0eb94e99cd43e",
      "text": "315 Production什么的，\n真是个unique的名字呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6a08be4ccfb18c1a34a72ff0acfc7462d167c4b79e2d40afe4004c513242c8",
      "text": "哇啊！？你刚才不是睡着了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff431986aca4d99789e37db43e861347ccb83951322cf4679442d5eb314fff1e",
      "text": "Mr. 山下！这家事务所，\n明天马上过去看看吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d5cd9acae19259e96e4852b54884bab42409945d709653e32058a57fda1575e",
      "text": "诶，明天？这也太突然了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef08308308ff148764634d9195af201eac7fe6b791effa76e16b4b6ef14ecc11",
      "text": "欲速则turn哦☆ ……对了！\n要成为偶像的话演出服可是很重要的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f990cd730d1cf85c98f58cd8499aaf83e7e07240684f683940e0056dfd2da3",
      "text": "穿上闪闪发光的cool演出服去吧！\n来个Impact满满的感觉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d80426c7bdde322c7c95b356cc2fd10dce8ba690ff1c6aa92c6d44e57b06c82",
      "text": "都还没出道呢，说什么演出服……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:005800b705b7a9806d9e6fc430e53b59d66338047e71354d6e7c411b6aaed50a",
      "text": "还有就是能有original song就更棒了呢！\n对了！这首歌怎么样？～～♪～～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7763cd3688edac9c0214f79b5feead0e84d6fcf6090e2d8c8288d519567e8acf",
      "text": "类、类！？……诶。\n难道说，睡着了？这也太快了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3dd960d07fe6c47cdc034898942b9e7af747255ebd0a44def493b53ee0273db",
      "text": "呼——……呼——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de4bcd0fc8fe7645af836d90a13bcc4a460c0178a3dce96765a0734458445d14",
      "text": "吵完这一通，又睡过去了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c1c2886af7b6c05da7c6c642b57bcb23f7f63fc568b3a4ccba6f0184b9dbe1",
      "text": "不过，嘛……正如类所说的，\n能做的事最好都去试一试吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8f60bd8c8d2bfc20d608715ab27e3131208f163c07c267663f4bf02f8ea70a",
      "text": "毕竟在硲先生面前，连“是认真的”\n这种话都说出口了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:721a65144f7e4adb8481e2938db98394b22249b77693df345d0e3574b1dd917b",
      "text": "好，总之先作为下一个备选，\n跟硲先生联络一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7fbe83f7e68d0cd6b7063f84a97172ba6a1d9662c186e0f332fff419850b79",
      "text": "Mr. 山下～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efbe10522d1a1de80cf015eda012747ab589101023ed26f921d1816f9af7253a",
      "text": "怎么，醒了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e711902b4bfe1b111790f3bef14402da1d09884c2f9eb9cbe7679e56e49e330e",
      "text": "下一次，要是能合格就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a99eb39c4eda71fdd5cb47a1621d2b6b2b26d29f59cd64d94e63fba8c89aa5",
      "text": "和Mr. 硲三个人一起实现梦想，\n要是能当上偶像，那就最棒了对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dd6a70345b9d42ef2c3455bd49e0ce406ede902b602b2efd2bde1f82c8aed8b",
      "text": "……是啊，那就最棒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a21c2918fcd036cc93f5c51d2274076e3c3dc870822dc65dc09a7f4cb289ba1",
      "text": "Yes！明天再一起加油吧！\n……呼——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a95f006b81c02f951fe4741d2156e56a0b7a30a0c1c5c94c5856357dbc9e7d",
      "text": "哎呀呀……睡了醒，醒了又睡。\n真是个忙碌的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_02_1_1_012_02:1_1_012_02_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e1d8db062c25556452dd214b480a223955faf72a3da4ed8ce91e9bba70172d",
      "text": "好了，记下315的号码……\n希望这次能合格吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
